  unicode-bom  This file starts with a byte order mark. In a project that is already UTF-8 everywhere the mark carries no information and is invisible in an editor, while tools that read the first bytes literally see it: a shell script stops being executable, a concatenated bundle gains a stray character mid-file, and a diff shows a change on a line nobody edited.

